; Direction of the last room change (0 right, 1 left, 2 down, 3 up)
;
; Set by #R$ACEF when the player crosses a screen edge: 0 = left the room through the right edge, 1 = left edge, 2 =
; bottom edge, 3 = top edge. #R$9B5A (called when a room is entered) indexes the four scroll set-ups at #R$9BD3 with
; it to choose from which side the new room is drawn in. Cleared by #R$85FC at the start of a game and by #R$9C52
; after a parchment has been read (so that the room is redrawn from the right).
@label=ExitDirection
g$850B DEFB $00
